          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بالضرورة (bi-ḍ-ḍarūra) is built on the native Arabic root ḍ-r-r, \"to harm; to compel\" (Lane). Ḍarūra is necessity, what one is compelled to; bi-ḍ-ḍarūra is by necessity. ضروري, necessary, is from the same root."
            }
          ]
        },
